Manage a file-based task board with epics, stories, tasks, and bugs.

Usage:
  task-board [command]

Available Commands:
  admin            Server administration (users, tokens, access)
  boards           List boards accessible to the current user (remote mode)
  claude           Launch Claude through the Task-board Session Manager
  codex            Attach Codex to the Task-board Session Manager
  completion       Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  export           Export current board into a tar.gz archive
  goal             Read and align the board-scoped parent primary goal
  grep             Full-text search across board files
  handoff          Verify role handoff evidence and move to the role end status
  help             Help about any command
  import           Import a tar.gz archive into the current board
  login            Store a token for the current remote
  logout           Remove active user's token for current remote
  m                Execute a mutation (write operation)
  migrate-keychain Import legacy remote credentials into macOS Keychain
  plan             Show execution plan with phases and critical path
  q                Query the board with a mini DSL
  repair-links     List or remove unsupported container dependency links
  resource         Upload, update, download, and delete board resources
  self-update      Update task-board to the latest version
  session          Inspect and stop Task-board Session Manager sessions
  spawn            Queue an agent spawn run for a board task
  switch-user      Switch active user for current remote
  tree             Show board as hierarchical tree
  tui              Launch interactive TUI
  validate         Validate board structure
  whoami           Show current remote and active user

Flags:
      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default ".task-board")
      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite
  -h, --help                     help for task-board
      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)
      --json                     Output in JSON format
      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check
      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)
      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)
  -v, --version                  version for task-board

Use "task-board [command] --help" for more information about a command.

